				<div class="project-card">
					<div class="project-header">
						<a href="https://investor.vanguard.com/advice/personal-financial-advice-options" target="_blank" class="project-title">vanguard PAS</a>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">Frontend engineering for Vanguard's Personal Advisor Services — digital wealth management serving millions of investors.</p>
					<div class="project-tags">
						<span class="tag">fintech</span>
						<span class="tag">frontend</span>
						<span class="tag">enterprise</span>
					</div>
					<div class="project-links">
						<a href="https://investor.vanguard.com/advice/personal-financial-advice-options" target="_blank">live ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="project-card">
					<div class="project-header">
						<a href="https://localizejs.com/products/documents" target="_blank" class="project-title">localize documents</a>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">Built the documents translation product at Localize — automated localization for web content at scale.</p>
					<div class="project-tags">
						<span class="tag">i18n</span>
						<span class="tag">saas</span>
						<span class="tag">javascript</span>
					</div>
					<div class="project-links">
						<a href="https://localizejs.com/products/documents" target="_blank">live ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="project-card">
					<div class="project-header">
						<a href="https://github.com/ccurme/yolopandas" target="_blank" class="project-title">yolopandas</a>
						<span class="project-stars">★ 200</span>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">Natural language interface for pandas dataframes. Ask questions in plain English, get data transformations back. Contributor.</p>
					<div class="project-tags">
						<span class="tag">python</span>
						<span class="tag">pandas</span>
						<span class="tag">nlp</span>
					</div>
					<div class="project-links">
						<a href="https://github.com/ccurme/yolopandas" target="_blank">github ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="project-card">
					<div class="project-header">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/bar" target="_blank" class="project-title">B.A.R</a>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">Burn After Reading — a self-hosted pastebin built with Go + HTMX. Pastes self-destruct after being read once.</p>
