						<span class="tag">go</span>
						<span class="tag">htmx</span>
						<span class="tag">self-hosted</span>
					</div>
					<div class="project-links">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/bar" target="_blank">github ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="project-card">
					<div class="project-header">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/nova" target="_blank" class="project-title">nova</a>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">A minimal note-taking CLI tool built in Rust. Fast, opinionated, terminal-native.</p>
					<div class="project-tags">
						<span class="tag">rust</span>
						<span class="tag">cli</span>
					</div>
					<div class="project-links">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/nova" target="_blank">github ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="project-card">
					<div class="project-header">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/snake-go" target="_blank" class="project-title">snake-go</a>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">Classic Snake game built with Go and Raylib. Because sometimes you just want to build something fun.</p>
					<div class="project-tags">
						<span class="tag">go</span>
						<span class="tag">raylib</span>
						<span class="tag">game</span>
					</div>
					<div class="project-links">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/snake-go" target="_blank">github ↗</a>
					</div>
