				<div class="project-card">
					<div class="project-header">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/aoc-2024-rust" target="_blank" class="project-title">advent of code 2024</a>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">Advent of Code 2024 solutions in Rust. Solving algorithmic puzzles with systems-level thinking.</p>
					<div class="project-tags">
						<span class="tag">rust</span>
						<span class="tag">algorithms</span>
					</div>
					<div class="project-links">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/aoc-2024-rust" target="_blank">github ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="project-card">
					<div class="project-header">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/PinPoint" target="_blank" class="project-title">pinpoint</a>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">Chrome extension for annotating YouTube videos. Bookmark and tag specific moments in any video.</p>
					<div class="project-tags">
						<span class="tag">javascript</span>
						<span class="tag">chrome-ext</span>
					</div>
					<div class="project-links">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/PinPoint" target="_blank">github ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="project-card">
					<div class="project-header">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/click_call" target="_blank" class="project-title">click call</a>
					</div>
					<p class="project-desc">Make phone calls directly from the browser. WebRTC-powered calling interface.</p>
					<div class="project-tags">
						<span class="tag">webrtc</span>
						<span class="tag">javascript</span>
					</div>
					<div class="project-links">
						<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides/click_call" target="_blank">github ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="work-footer">
				<a href="https://github.com/aliyeysides" target="_blank">see more on github ↗</a>
